---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import CaptureForm from "../../components/forms/capture-form.astro";
import { capture } from "../../../capture.config";
---

<Layout title="Split PDF Online" seo={{ page_description: "Extract pages from a PDF document easily." }}>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-8">
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-balance md:text-5xl">Split PDF</h1>
      <p class="mb-10 text-lg text-slate-600">Extract pages from a large PDF document securely.</p>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Select File to Split</h2>
        <noscript>
          <div class="bg-rose-50 text-rose-800 p-4 rounded mb-4">
            JavaScript is required to perform local file splitting. Without JS, files must be sent via our contact form.
          </div>
        </noscript>
        <div id="tool-ui" class="text-center p-12 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 rounded-lg bg-slate-50">
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">Drag and drop a PDF file here.</p>
          <button class="bg-emerald-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded hover:bg-emerald-700 transition">Browse File</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none mb-12">
        <h2>Why Split a PDF?</h2>
        <p>
          Often, you receive a massive 50-page document, but you only need to sign and return page 12. Splitting the PDF allows you to extract exactly what you need. Need to <a href="/tools/sign-pdf">Sign a PDF</a>? Extract the page first, sign it, and you're good to go.
        </p>

        <h3>How it Works</h3>
        <p>
          1. Upload your file.<br/>
          2. Type the range of pages (e.g. <code>1-5, 8, 11-13</code>).<br/>
          3. Export the newly split PDF document.
        </p>

        <h3>Edge Cases</h3>
        <p>Ensure that you have <a href="/blog/remove-pdf-password">unlocked your password protected PDF</a> before attempting to split the document.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Want to know when we add Cloud Sync?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">We are adding direct Google Drive and Dropbox integrations. Join the waitlist.</p>
        <CaptureForm form={capture.forms.waitlist} submitLabel="Join Waitlist">
          <div>
            <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">Email address</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required class="w-full rounded border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2 focus:border-emerald-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-600" />
          </div>
        </CaptureForm>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
